{"title": "第五次漫步　逻辑小遛圈", "index": 16, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<h1 class=\"kindle-cn-heading\" id=\"111-7170a1ff379b4fe085230bbf7b77805b\">第五次漫步　逻辑小遛圈</h1>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-kai\">这次漫步，我的任务是：向孟弟解释一种名为三段论的逻辑论证方法。</p>\n<p class=\"page-break\" id=\"calibre_pb_1\"></p>\n</body>"}]}